I've been thinking about these quest artifacts. Most of them seem
kind of, well, arbitrary. Made up. I mean, "Orb of Fate"? "Orb
of Searching" (or whatever it was)?  Surely, there are more fitting
artifacts. For example:
Archeologist: the Ark of the Covenant
Caveman: the Wheel
Elf: the One Ring
Knight: the Holy Grail, of course.
Priest: the Dead Sea Scrolls, perhaps? (Okay, wrong religion, I know.)
Rogue: the Maltese Falcon.
Tourist: A gold-plated replica of the Eiffel Tower. (okay, PYEC is good too.)
Valkyrie: the Ring of the Niebelungen

I admit that some of these are far too powerful for the game.
(Once you have the Ring (either of them), who needs the Amulet of
Yendor?) Anyway, just a thought.

